shotContent.prompt:
subject_definitions:
<Subject 1> is RILEY, a 24-year-old woman with natural, slender, unslimmed proportions. She has a soft, pretty face with faint freckles, warm brown eyes and straight dark brows. She wears thin, round silver wire-rimmed glasses. Her auburn-brown hair is pulled back into a small, low ponytail with a black hair tie, and short, loose strands frame her face. The authored text calls this short auburn hair that she tucks behind one ear. <Audio 1> (Posh Riley) is the voice timbre of RILEY (S1). She speaks no words in this shot and makes only one sharp intake of breath.
- <Picture 1> supplies her face, freckles, eyes, brows, glasses and hair only. Its grey top and cream backdrop are not used.
- <Video 2> reinforces her face, glasses, hair and the circlet in close-up. It also supplies her natural full-body proportions, including bare legs and bare feet.
- <Picture 7> supplies the front of her Elementalist costume, <Picture 5> its side profile and <Picture 6> its back. The costume consists of:
  - a fitted lavender satin corset bodice with raised silver-piped vertical seams;
  - a sheer lavender mesh yoke, crossed at the front by angular silver strap lines;
  - a sheer mesh upper back edged by thin lavender straps, with a slim centre-back seam down the corset;
  - a high silver-edged stand collar with a small faceted blue crystal at the throat;
  - sculpted angular silver hip plates that meet in a downward point at the front and in a shallow V at the back waist;
  - a short, layered ruffled lavender skirt;
  - long lavender opera-length gloves with angular silver forearm guards;
  - a circlet of fine twisted silver bands, centred by one large diamond-shaped, faceted blue-violet crystal at the hairline.
- The authored design and the previous shot change this costume as follows:
  - The bodice has an iridescent lavender-to-blue sheen.
  - The under-ruffles are deep blue instead of pale pink.
  - The skirt is equally short all the way around, with no train.
- Her face, glasses and hair stay identical to <Picture 1> throughout.
<Subject 2> is Riley's desk, supplied by <Picture 2> and <Picture 3>. It has:
- a warm honey-wood top;
- a black mechanical keyboard with rainbow RGB backlighting and a black wrist rest;
- a black mouse pad with a mouse;
- two small black speakers;
- a white mug at the left end;
- a white-shaded table lamp at the right end, switched off;
- a few loose papers near the lamp.
<Subject 3> is Riley's matte-black gaming headset, supplied by <Picture 2>. It lies at the left rear of the desk, with a glowing blue ring on each outer cup.
<Subject 4> is Riley's monitor, supplied by <Picture 2>. It is a thin black flat-panel display on a black stand at the centre of the desk. None of its desktop text or app layout appears; its screen becomes the window to Runeterra.
<Subject 5> is Riley's dark, cluttered night-time bedroom, supplied by <Picture 3> and <Picture 2>. It has:
- cream walls, beige carpet and a textured ceiling with an unlit round fixture;
- a large fantasy poster above the desk and a smaller dark poster to its right, both lost in shadow;
- an unmade bed with a grey upholstered headboard at the far right;
- a small wooden side table stacked with unopened white mail envelopes;
- discarded clothes on the floor.
Every lamp and the ceiling light are off, and the ceiling is undamaged.
<Subject 6> is Riley's pink racing-style gaming chair, supplied by <Video 1>. It is soft pink faux leather with a tall winged backrest. Its back is a smooth pink panel with two black-rimmed cut-outs near the top, edged with thin iridescent purple-blue piping. It has black armrests and a black five-star base with pink leg inlays and black twin-wheel casters.
<Subject 7> is the sunlit Noxian alley seen through the monitor, supplied by <Picture 4>. It has:
- pale, weathered stone-block walls and worn cobblestones;
- bright, warm raking daylight under a pale sky;
- a tall dark banner with a deep crimson border and a pale metallic emblem, hanging from the wall.
summary:
Generate a static wide shot from behind <Subject 1>, who stands barefoot in her lavender-and-silver Elementalist costume facing <Subject 2> in the dark <Subject 5>. The screen of <Subject 4> brightens into a window onto the sunlit stone of <Subject 7>, where a crimson-bordered banner stirs in the breeze. Warm daylight spills into the night-dark bedroom. A draft pulls her skirt toward the screen, and she plants a hand on the desk to steady herself. She ends braced, her silhouette set against a bright doorway of daylight.
retention_analysis:
- <Picture 1>: keep Riley's face, freckles, glasses and low auburn-brown ponytail with loose strands. From behind, mainly the hair, a glasses arm and a sliver of cheek are visible. Do not keep the grey top, backdrop or portrait framing.
- <Video 2>: keep her likeness, natural proportions, bare legs and feet, and the circlet's crystal and twisted bands. The inspected previews show only frontal views, so the back comes from <Picture 6>. Do not copy its neutral pose, pale backdrop, orbit or framing.
- <Picture 6>, <Picture 5> and <Picture 7>:
  - <Picture 6> is the primary guide, because this shot sees her from behind. Keep its mesh upper back, silver-piped corset back, centre-back seam, V-shaped hip plates, glove guards and ponytail tie.
  - <Picture 5> and <Picture 7> keep the side and front construction consistent.
  - Change: the pale-pink under-ruffles become deep blue, the bodice gains an iridescent sheen, and the authored side panels are added.
  - Do not copy their stiff poses or white backdrops.
- <Picture 2> and <Picture 3>:
  - Keep: the desk arrangement, keyboard, mug, headset, monitor, posters, walls, carpet, bed, clothes and mail stack.
  - Change: the lamp and ceiling light are off, the monitor's desktop is replaced by the window to Runeterra, and there is no ceiling dent.
  - Do not copy: their camera positions, the open bedroom door or the poster art in any detail.
- <Video 1>: keep the chair's smooth pink back, black cut-outs, piping and base. Do not copy its orbit, white backdrop or readable wordmark.
- <Picture 4>: transfer only the pale sunlit stone, cobbles, daylight and one crimson-bordered banner, seen through the screen. Do not copy its full composition, crates, barrels, lantern or distant tower.
Lighting, pose and framing are newly directed. The opening differs from the previous shot's frontal, floor-level view: the camera now stands behind Riley at chest height, facing the monitor.
detailed_description:
[Shot 1] is one continuous take lasting 9.42 seconds, in 16:9, with no cuts. The camera is fully locked off at chest height, about three paces behind <Subject 1>. It frames a static wide shot looking past her toward <Subject 2> and <Subject 4> against the far wall of <Subject 5>. The camera never moves; only the light, the wind and Riley change. The wide distance keeps her short skirt reading simply as a hem line.

Riley stands a little right of frame centre, seen from behind, one step from the desk. Her low ponytail and loose strands sit beneath the thin silver band of the circlet. Her sheer mesh upper back, silver-piped corset, V-shaped hip plates and lavender and deep-blue ruffles hang still. Her gloves reach above her elbows, and her bare feet rest on the beige carpet.

<Subject 6> sits rolled back at the lower-right foreground, its smooth pink back and black cut-outs toward camera. The small side table with its stack of unopened mail sits at the lower-left edge. On the desk are the rainbow-lit keyboard, the white mug, the blue-ringed <Subject 3> and the unlit lamp. The shadowed posters, cream walls and the grey headboard at the right edge sit in near darkness.

From 0 to about 1.5 seconds, the screen is already brightening from a navy-and-lavender glow. Riley goes still, her arms at her sides, as the glow swells around her outline.

From about 1.5 to 3.5 seconds, the screen flares white-gold, then clears like a window opening onto <Subject 7>. Sunlit pale stone blocks and cobbles appear beyond the monitor frame, and a tall crimson-bordered banner stirs in the breeze. Warm daylight pours through the bezel in a broad shaft. It washes the desk and carpet, rims Riley's outline in gold and throws her long shadow back toward the camera. Dust motes glitter in the beam, while the corners of the room stay night-dark.

From about 3.5 to 6.0 seconds, a draft pulls toward the screen. Her loose strands and ponytail lift forward. The ruffles stream toward the monitor. She leans back against the pull, and her bare heels skid a few centimetres. The loose papers and the top envelopes of the mail riffle.

From about 6.0 to 8.0 seconds, the pull tips her forward. She shoots out her right arm and plants her gloved palm flat on the desk beside the mouse pad, fingers splayed and elbow locked. The mug rattles. Her left arm swings out for balance, and her shoulders set. Her head turns slightly, so a sliver of freckled cheek and the silver arm of her glasses catch the light. She draws one sharp breath without speaking.

From about 8.0 seconds to the end, she holds the brace. In the last frame of [Shot 1], Riley stands in silhouette against the blazing doorway of daylight, right hand planted on the desk. Her strands, side panels and ruffles stream toward the light, and the banner ripples beyond.
overall_soundscape:
Daylight invades the night on a rushing breeze. The monitor's low hum swells, then opens into outdoor air. Wind rushes through the screen, and the distant banner flaps. Physical sounds follow the action:
- fabric flutters and snaps as the side panels stream forward;
- the hip plates give a faint metallic tink;
- her bare heels squeak on the carpet;
- papers and envelopes riffle;
- her palm lands on the wood with a firm thump;
- the mug rattles.
Riley's one sharp breath is in the timbre of <Audio 1>. There are no words.
non_diegetic_music:
An airy, rising adventure motif. Soft sustained strings and a bright horn line swell as the daylight opens and climb steadily with the draft. The cue crests on an open, expectant chord as she braces against the light.

